OL,3,GNEWSAOffenders help clear nurdles after
OL,4,Amajor spill
OL,5,
OL,6,FOffenders have been clearing plastic
OL,7,Fnurdles from a beach as part of one of
OL,8,Fthe region's largest environmental
OL,9,Frecovery efforts.
OL,11,FThey were taking part in a community
OL,12,Fpayback scheme at Newbiggin in
OL,13,FNorthumberland, removing the tiny
OL,14,Fplastic pellets after a major spill in
OL,15,Fthe North Sea.
OL,17,FVolunteers and councils also took part
OL,18,Fin the clean-up on Thursday after an
OL,19,Festimated one billion balls were lost
OL,20,Fwhen two vessels collided at the Port
OL,21,Fof Tyne in July.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
